meta {
  name: Configure Kustom Adapter
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

put {
  url: {{configurationUrl}}/api/v1/configuration/merchants/{{merchant}}/channels/{{channel}}/configurations/klarna_checkout_adapter
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  x-merchant: {{merchant}}
  x-channel: {{channel}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "$schema": "https://{{slug}}.api-se.playground.norce.tech/checkout/klarna-adapter/openapi/v1/schemas/klarna_checkout_adapter.json",
    "id": "klarna_checkout_adapter",
    "apiSettings": {
      "apiUrl": "{{kustomApiUrl}}",
      "username": "{{kustomUsername}}",
      "password": "{{kustomPassword}}"
    },
    "redirectUrls": {
      "termsUrl": "https://norce.io/terms",
      "checkoutUrl": "https://norce.io/checkout",
      "confirmationUrl": "https://app.checkout{{environment}}.internal.norce.tech/neworderconfirmation?orderId={orderId}&channel={channel}",
      "validationErrorUrl": "https://norce.io/checkout/error"
    },
    "shippingCountries": [
      "SE",
      "NO",
      "FI",
      "DK"
    ],
    "options": {
      "allowedCustomerTypes": [
        "person",
        "organization"
      ],
      "merchantReferenceSource": "OrderId",
      "acquiringChannel": "ECOMMERCE",
      "colorButton": "#000000",
      "colorButtonText": "#ffffff",
      "radiusBorder": "4px"
    },
    "adapter": {
      "internalUrl": "https://klarna-adapter.checkout.{{internal_environment}}.internal.norce.tech",
      "publicUrl": "{{kustomAdapterUrl}}"
    },
    "active": true
  }
}

docs {
  # Configure Kustom Adapter (Klarna Checkout / KCO)

  Sets up the **Kustom Checkout** payment adapter for the `nc-kustom-se` channel. Kustom is the new name for **Klarna Checkout (KCO)** — Klarna is transitioning KCO to Kustom, but in Norce Checkout (NCO) it is still the **same adapter component**, `klarna_checkout_adapter`. Only the configuration changes:

  - **API URL** points at Kustom's endpoints instead of Klarna's (`api.playground.kustom.co` for Playground, `api.kustom.co` for production — the old `api.klarna.com` host remains functional during the transition).
  - **Credentials** (`username` / `password`) are the merchant credentials provided by Kustom.

  Like Walley, this is a **hosted checkout** adapter: it returns an HTML snippet that the frontend embeds to render the Kustom/Klarna iframe. Configuration here covers the API credentials, the redirect URLs (terms, checkout, confirmation, validation error), the allowed shipping countries (ISO alpha-2), and UI/behaviour options such as `allowedCustomerTypes` (B2C/B2B) and `merchantReferenceSource`.

  > **Redirect URL placeholders:** only `confirmationUrl` supports placeholders (`{orderId}`, `{channel}`) — the adapter substitutes these before sending the order to Klarna/Kustom. `termsUrl`, `checkoutUrl` and `validationErrorUrl` are passed through **verbatim**, so they must be plain, valid URLs. Putting `{merchant}`/`{channel}` in them leaves literal `{` `}` characters in the URL, which Klarna rejects with `BAD_VALUE: merchant_url.terms` when initiating payment.

  > Note: this is the **NCO** adapter, not the legacy Storm/Shopping KCO integration.
}
